<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46203" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζέφῠρος</span></b> , ὁ, any
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>westerly wind</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βορέης καὶ Ζ., τώ τε Θρῄκηθεν
					ἄητον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.5
				</span></i>
			: coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νότος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				21.334
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὖρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.332
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.206
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζ. δυσαής, ἔφυδρος</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				5.295
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.458
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					946a17
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδιεινὸς καὶ
			ἥδιστος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				943b21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπότε νέφεα Ζ. στυφελίξῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.305
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμα πνοιῇ Ζεφύροιο
			θέοιμεν</span>, of horses, <i><span class="en">
				19.415
			</span></i>; later, <i>the due West wind</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπηλιώτης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				363b12
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Mu.</u>
				394b26
			</span></i>; but rather <i>northwest</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1290a19
			</span></i>. (Prob. cogn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζόφος</span>,
			cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζοφόπνοια</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
